     "n": "1",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The description says $27 controls the operation of timers A and B; the glyphs of the verb are garbled in the capture.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:YM3438.raw.txt",
       "lines": "397",
       "sha": "49c7e511feb50c51596fad923e9ef103d23e088d1c5f491ebdfffe7d21356a9f"
